        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Veljko Čubrilović, Archduke Franz Ferdinand of Austria\n- Roles: Bosnian Serb, Archduke of Austria-Este, heir presumptive to the Austro-Hungarian throne, Royal Prince of Hungary and of Bohemia\n- Events: Assassination of Archduke Franz Ferdinand of Austria\n\nFacts:\n- Archduke Franz Ferdinand of Austria was born on 18 December 1863.\n- From 1896 until his death, Archduke Franz Ferdinand of Austria was heir presumptive to the Austro-Hungarian throne.\n- Veljko Čubrilović was born on 6 June 1886.\n- Archduke Franz Ferdinand of Austria was an Archduke of Austria-Este and a Royal Prince of Hungary and of Bohemia.\n- Archduke Franz Ferdinand of Austria died on 28 June 1914.\n- Veljko Čubrilović was a Bosnian Serb involved in the assassination of Archduke Franz Ferdinand of Austria.\n- Veljko Čubrilović died on 3 February 1915.",
